OL,3,GNEWSASue Cleaver hails Dinnerladies
OL,4,Astage tour as Victoria Wood's legacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FActress Sue Cleaver has said Victoria
OL,7,FWood would be "over the moon" with a
OL,8,Fnew stage adaptation of beloved sitcom
OL,9,FDinnerladies, which she hailed as "a
OL,10,Fcelebration of her legacy".
OL,12,FBest known as Eileen Grimshaw in ITV
OL,13,Fsoap Coronation Street, Cleaver is
OL,14,Famong the famous faces joining the new
OL,15,Fproduction, which is the first to be
OL,16,Fcommissioned by Wood's estate since her
OL,17,Fdeath in 2016 at the age of 62.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
