OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASue Cleaver hails Dinnerladies
OL,4,Astage tour as Victoria Wood's legacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 63-year-old, who featured in the
OL,7,FBBC show as a recurring character, will
OL,8,Ftake the stage as cynical canteen
OL,9,Fworker Jean, who was played by Anne
OL,10,FReid in the show.
OL,12,FShe said the script it "blew her away"
OL,13,Fand that it had been "beautifully
OL,14,Fadapted" from Wood's show.
